OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying mostly dry, with spells
OL,6,Fof warm sunshine. The chance of a few
OL,7,Fshowers drifting in from the south
OL,8,Fthrough the day, mainly effecting the
OL,9,Fsouth and the southwest. Turning humid
OL,10,Fin the south later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry and clear start
OL,13,Fthe evening with rain moving into the
OL,14,Fsouth. Turning showery and possibly
OL,15,Fheavy in places as cloud lowers.
OL,16,FSlightly warmer than previous nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
