OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FShowers drift northwards
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, turning drier for
OL,7,Fa time in the afternoon. Some more
OL,8,Fisolated showers may return
OL,9,Fmidafternoon. Warmer than Tuesday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FChangeable weather with spells of
OL,13,Fheavy rain, some thunderstorms and
OL,14,Fstrong winds. Brighter intervals and
OL,15,Fscattered showers at times.
OL,16,FTemperatures mostly near normal,
OL,17,Ffeeling warm and humid in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
